<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA NAME SQUAD FOR ASIA CUP.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA NAME SQUAD FOR ASIA CUP.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka on Thursday announced a 14-man squad for next month's four-nation Asia Cup tournament in Colombo.</p>
<p>India, Pakistan and Bangladesh are also playing in the tournament which takes place from July 14-26.</p>
<p>The Sri Lanka squad is: Arjuna Ranatunga (captain), Sanath Jayasuriya, Mavan Atapattu, Aravinda de Silva, Romesh Kaluwitharana, Kumar Dharmasena, Roshan Mahanama, Upul Chandana, Ruwan Kalpage, Muttiah Muralitharan, Sajeeva de Silva, Chaminda Vaas, Lanka de Silva, Dulip Liyanage.</p>
